                  "Children": [
                    {
                      "$type": "Models.Memo, Models",
                      "Text": "\nThe parameter KL is is described by Meinke et al (1993) to combine elements of soil conductivity (K) with root length (L) in determining root water uptake.  Peake et al (2013) demonstrated that in maize KL varied with plant population through impacts on root length density.  Here we adjust KL linearly with plant population.\n",
